<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><title>QuickTicket Tester Portal</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,Arial;background:#f5f7fb;color:#182033}.top{background:#101426;color:#fff;padding:18px 6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.logo{font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:#ff5366}.wrap{padding:35px 6%}.hero{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#151a2d,#394264);color:#fff;border-radius:22px;padding:30px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.hero img{width:230px;height:145px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px}.hero p{color:#d1d5e4;max-width:650px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin:24px 0}.card{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.07)}.stat{font-size:32px;font-weight:900}.pass{color:#168653}.fail{color:#c62828}.warn{color:#b26b00}.table{overflow:auto}.table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:800px}.table th,.table td{padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e6ec;text-align:left}.table th{background:#f7f8fb}.badge{padding:5px 9px;border-radius:14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.p{background:#e8f8ef;color:#168653}.n{background:#ffecef;color:#c62828}.todo{background:#fff4d8;color:#9a6500}.case{margin-top:20px}.case h3{margin-bottom:5px}.checklist{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.item{padding:13px;background:#f7f8fb;border-radius:9px}@media(max-width:850px){.hero{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.hero img{width:100%;margin-top:15px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.checklist{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:500px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><div class="top"><div class="logo">🎟️ QuickTicket</div><div>TESTER PORTAL</div></div><div class="wrap">
<div class="hero"><div><h1>Quality & Validation Hub</h1><p>Use this dashboard to execute functional testing for registration, booking, seat availability, admin sync and digital tickets.</p></div><img src="assets/m3.jpg" alt="Movie"></div>
<div class="grid"><div class="card"><div>TEST CASES</div><div class="stat">12</div></div><div class="card"><div>PASS</div><div class="stat pass">10</div></div><div class="card"><div>FAIL</div><div class="stat fail">0</div></div><div class="card"><div>BLOCKED</div><div class="stat warn">2</div></div></div>
<div class="card table"><h2>Functional Test Cases</h2><table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Scenario</th><th>Expected Result</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>QT-001</td><td>Register new user</td><td>Account is created and user can login</td><td><span class="badge p">PASS</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>QT-002</td><td>Duplicate email</td><td>System displays email already registered</td><td><span class="badge p">PASS</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>QT-003</td><td>Valid login</td><td>User enters movie area</td><td><span class="badge p">PASS</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>QT-004</td><td>Invalid login</td><td>Error message is shown</td><td><span class="badge p">PASS</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>QT-005</td><td>Select available seat</td><td>Seat changes to selected state</td><td><span class="badge p">PASS</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>QT-006</td><td>Booked seat</td><td>Seat is disabled</td><td><span class="badge p">PASS</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>QT-007</td><td>Confirm booking</td><td>Booking ID and ticket are generated</td><td><span class="badge p">PASS</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>QT-008</td><td>My Bookings</td><td>Customer sees own bookings</td><td><span class="badge p">PASS</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>QT-009</td><td>Admin booking sync</td><td>Admin dashboard reflects new booking</td><td><span class="badge p">PASS</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>QT-010</td><td>Hall full condition</td><td>30/30 seats shows HALL FULL</td><td><span class="badge p">PASS</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>QT-011</td><td>Print digital ticket</td><td>Browser print dialog opens</td><td><span class="badge todo">BLOCKED</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>QT-012</td><td>Responsive mobile view</td><td>Layout adapts without horizontal overflow</td><td><span class="badge todo">BLOCKED</span></td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<div class="card case"><h2>🧪 Regression Checklist</h2><div class="checklist"><div class="item">☐ Clear old localStorage data before clean test</div><div class="item">☐ Create two different customer accounts</div><div class="item">☐ Book different seats for the same hall</div><div class="item">☐ Confirm previously booked seats cannot be selected</div><div class="item">☐ Check admin revenue after booking</div><div class="item">☐ Verify ticket contains correct customer and seat data</div><div class="item">☐ Test all movie cards</div><div class="item">☐ Capture screenshots for failed cases</div></div></div>
</div></body></html>
